# 行尾统一:仓库内一律 LF,检出时也是 LF。
#
# 之前没有这个文件,而本机 core.autocrlf=true,于是每次 checkout 都会把
# 工作区的 LF 换成 CRLF,18 个文件持续报 "LF will be replaced by CRLF",
# 换来的是一堆无意义的整文件 diff。这里把策略写死在仓库里。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制:不做行尾转换,不当文本 diff
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary

# 锁文件:由包管理器生成,保持原样
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
motion/package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
